# PROJECT: F1RST BANK OF NIGERIA — FULL DIGITAL BANKING PLATFORM

Act as a senior fintech product designer, banking software architect, full-stack developer, cybersecurity engineer, and database specialist.

Build a modern, responsive, premium-quality digital banking website and online banking platform named **F1RST BANK OF NIGERIA**.

The platform should deliver a polished, trustworthy Nigerian banking experience, with a professional corporate website, customer online banking portal, and secure administrative dashboard.

The design should feel modern, reliable, premium, fast, accessible, and suitable for Nigerian individuals, students, entrepreneurs, SMEs, and corporate customers.

IMPORTANT: Treat this project as an independent banking software concept unless the organization has confirmed authorization to operate as a bank. Do not falsely claim affiliation with FirstBank of Nigeria or any existing financial institution. Use fictional demo data and clearly label the application as a demo until the business's legal identity, licensing, payment integrations, and regulatory approvals are verified.

